(51, 1, '2025-11-10 17:14:30', '2025-11-10 11:44:30', '<strong>Last updated: 21-12-2025</strong>\r\n\r\nWelcome to King Tailors. By accessing or using our website and services, you agree to comply with and be bound by the following Terms &amp; Conditions. Please read them carefully.\r\n\r\nIf you do not agree with any part of these terms, please do not use our website or services.\r\n<h3>1. About Us</h3>\r\nKing Tailors is a local business based in Ozar, Nashik, providing men’s tailoring services, sewing machine sales and repairs, air cooler sales, servicing, and spare parts.\r\n<h3>2. Use of Website</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>The content on this website is for general information purposes only.</li>\r\n 	<li>We reserve the right to update, change, or remove any content without prior notice.</li>\r\n 	<li>You agree not to misuse the website or attempt unauthorized access.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>3. Services &amp; Products</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>All tailoring, repair, and servicing work is provided based on customer requirements.</li>\r\n 	<li>Product availability (sewing machines, air coolers, spare parts) is subject to stock.</li>\r\n 	<li>Prices, specifications, and service timelines may change without prior notice.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>4. Orders, Payments &amp; Estimates</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Any price estimates provided are approximate and may vary based on actual work required.</li>\r\n 	<li>Payments must be made as agreed at the time of order or service completion.</li>\r\n 	<li>King Tailors reserves the right to refuse or cancel any order if necessary.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>5. Alterations &amp; Custom Work</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Tailoring services involve custom work, and results may vary based on fabric, design, and measurements.</li>\r\n 	<li>Minor variations in fitting or finish are normal in tailoring services.</li>\r\n 	<li>Once stitching or alteration work has started, orders cannot be cancelled.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>6. Repairs &amp; Servicing</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Sewing machine and air cooler repairs depend on the condition of the product.</li>\r\n 	<li>While we aim to provide reliable service, we do not guarantee permanent repair in all cases.</li>\r\n 	<li>Warranty, if any, applies only to the specific repair or part replaced and for the agreed period.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>7. Returns, Refunds &amp; Exchanges</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Custom tailoring services are non-refundable.</li>\r\n 	<li>Sales of machines, coolers, and spare parts are subject to inspection at the time of purchase.</li>\r\n 	<li>Refunds or exchanges, if applicable, are at the sole discretion of King Tailors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>8. Intellectual Property</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>All content on this website, including text, images, logos, and designs, is the property of King Tailors.</li>\r\n 	<li>Unauthorized copying, reproduction, or distribution is prohibited.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>9. External Links</h3>\r\nOur website may contain links to third-party websites. We are not responsible for the content, policies, or practices of these external sites.\r\n<h3>10. Limitation of Liability</h3>\r\nKing Tailors shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from the use of our website, products, or services.\r\n<h3>11. Privacy</h3>\r\nYour use of this website is also governed by our Privacy Policy, which explains how we collect and use personal information.\r\n<h3>12. Changes to Terms &amp; Conditions</h3>\r\nWe reserve the right to update or modify these Terms &amp; Conditions at any time. Changes will be effective immediately upon posting on this page.\r\n<h3>13. Governing Law</h3>\r\nThese Terms &amp; Conditions shall be governed and interpreted in accordance with the laws of India. Any disputes shall be subject to the jurisdiction of Nashik, Maharashtra.\r\n<h3>14. Contact Us</h3>\r\nIf you have any questions regarding these Terms &amp; Conditions, please contact us:\r\n\r\n<strong>King Tailors</strong>\r\nOzar, Nashik\r\n+91-9767487130\r\nkingtailorsozar@gmail.com', 'Terms & Conditions', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'terms-conditions', '', '', '2025-12-25 22:40:49', '2025-12-25 17:10:49', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8080/wordpress/?page_id=51', 0, 'page', '', 0),
