(254, 1, '2025-11-16 22:56:58', '2025-11-16 17:26:58', 'Master Sewing Machine Umbrella Model is a traditional heavy-duty tailoring machine known for its strong build, smooth motion, and long-lasting performance. Designed for tailors, boutiques, home sewing users, and small garment units, this machine features the classic full shuttle system, offering superior stitch strength and reliable results on thick and thin fabrics.\r\n\r\nWith its umbrella-style mechanism and robust metal construction, the Master Sewing Machine ensures effortless operation, stable stitching, and excellent durability. It is ideal for stitching cotton, silk, uniforms, fall-pico work, blouses, daily tailoring, and general garment construction. Easy to maintain and simple to operate, this machine remains a trusted choice for both beginner and professional tailors.\r\n\r\n<strong>Key Features</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Full Shuttle Mechanism: Provides strong, durable stitches for long-lasting garment construction.</li>\r\n 	<li>Heavy-Duty Build: Robust metal body designed for years of reliable performance.</li>\r\n 	<li>Smooth Umbrella System: Ensures effortless hand or motor operation with minimal vibration.</li>\r\n 	<li>Multi-Fabric Compatible: Works well on cotton, silk, synthetics, and light-to-medium fabrics.</li>\r\n 	<li>Ideal for Tailoring Work: Suitable for blouses, fall-pico, dressmaking, alterations, and daily stitching.</li>\r\n 	<li>Classic Tailor’s Choice: Traditional design trusted by professional tailors across India.</li>\r\n 	<li>Easy to Maintain: Simple parts, low maintenance, and affordable servicing.</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Master Sewing Machine Umbrella Model', 'Master Sewing Machine Umbrella Model Full Shuttle – Traditional, heavy-duty tailoring machine with smooth operation. Ideal for all daily stitching needs. In stock.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'master-sewing-machine-umbrella-model', '', '', '2026-01-18 13:07:06', '2026-01-18 07:37:06', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8080/wordpress/?post_type=sewing_machine&#038;p=254', 0, 'sewing_machine', '', 0),
