(562, 1, '2025-12-06 21:03:04', '2025-12-06 15:33:04', 'Sony Embroidery Sewing Machine is a versatile and high-performance stitching machine designed for both home and professional use. Perfect for creative tailoring, decorative stitching, and garment finishing, this machine combines the reliability of Sony engineering with the flexibility of zig-zag and embroidery stitches.\r\n\r\nWith its smooth operation, strong needle penetration, and durable metal construction, the Sony machine handles light to medium-weight fabrics effortlessly. It is ideal for creating decorative patterns, embroidery designs, and reinforced stitches on blouses, dresses, uniforms, and home textiles.\r\n\r\nThis machine is easy to operate, low maintenance, and delivers consistent stitch quality, making it a trusted choice for beginners, tailoring shops, and boutique embroidery work.\r\n\r\n<strong>Key Features</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Zig-Zag &amp; Embroidery Stitches – Perfect for decorative stitching and creative tailoring</li>\r\n 	<li>Heavy-Duty Metal Body – Ensures durability and long-lasting performance</li>\r\n 	<li>Smooth Operation – Low vibration and consistent stitch output</li>\r\n 	<li>Multi-Fabric Compatibility – Works efficiently on cotton, silk, synthetics, and light to medium fabrics</li>\r\n 	<li>Beginner-Friendly Design – Easy threading, simple stitch selection, and adjustable tension</li>\r\n 	<li>Ideal for Tailoring Shops &amp; Boutique Work – Blouses, dresses, uniforms, and decorative embroidery</li>\r\n 	<li>Low Maintenance – Reliable mechanical components for long-term use</li>\r\n 	<li>Availability – In Stock</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Sony Embroidery Sewing Machine', 'Sony Embroidery Sewing Machine buy for decorative stitching and tailoring. Durable, versatile, and beginner-friendly. In stock now.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'sony-embroidery-sewing-machine', '', '', '2026-01-17 19:16:19', '2026-01-17 13:46:19', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8080/wordpress/?post_type=sewing_machine&#038;p=562', 0, 'sewing_machine', '', 0),
