(593, 1, '2025-12-07 02:57:23', '2025-12-06 21:27:23', 'Usha Manual Sewing Machine is a classic and durable hand-operated tailoring machine designed for home users, beginners, and small tailoring shops. Known for its smooth mechanical operation, stable stitch quality, and strong full-shuttle mechanism, this Usha model is perfect for everyday garment stitching, alterations, fall–pico, blouse work, and basic sewing tasks.\r\n\r\nBuilt with a robust cast-iron body, this machine offers long-lasting performance with very low maintenance. Its easy hand-wheel operation, simple threading system, and lightweight design make it suitable for all age groups—ideal for learning sewing, home tailoring, and small boutiques.\r\n\r\nWhether you\'re stitching cotton, silk, or lightweight fabrics, the Usha manual machine delivers precise and neat stitches every time.\r\n\r\n<strong>Key Features</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Full Shuttle Mechanism for smooth and consistent stitch formation</li>\r\n 	<li>Durable Cast-Iron Body – long-lasting and reliable</li>\r\n 	<li>Easy Hand Operation – beginner-friendly and hassle-free</li>\r\n 	<li>Suitable for Light &amp; Medium Fabrics</li>\r\n 	<li>Perfect for Home Tailoring &amp; Small Boutiques</li>\r\n 	<li>Low Maintenance Design</li>\r\n 	<li>Portable &amp; Lightweight</li>\r\n 	<li>Classic Usha Build Quality</li>\r\n 	<li>Availability – In Stock</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Usha Manual Sewing Machine', 'Usha Manual Sewing Machine buy for home stitching and tailoring. Strong, durable, and beginner-friendly with full shuttle mechanism. In stock and ready to use.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'usha-manual-sewing-machine', '', '', '2026-01-23 20:59:10', '2026-01-23 15:29:10', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8080/wordpress/?post_type=sewing_machine&#038;p=593', 0, 'sewing_machine', '', 0),
(602, 1, '2025-12-07 03:08:27', '2025-12-06 21:38:27', 'Samrat Tower Air Cooler is a stylish, space-saving, and powerful air cooler designed for homes, offices, shops, and small commercial spaces. Built with a high-speed motor, large honeycomb cooling pads, and a tall tower design, it delivers strong air throw and fast cooling while fitting easily in compact areas.\r\n\r\nIts slim, modern build enhances ventilation in bedrooms, living rooms, cabins, tailoring shops, and workplaces. The low power consumption motor ensures efficient cooling with minimal electricity use. The Samrat Tower Cooler also includes smooth mobility, easy maintenance, and long operating hours thanks to its large water tank.\r\n\r\nIf you need a cooler that is powerful, stylish, and perfect for small-to-medium rooms, the Samrat Tower Cooler is an excellent choice.\r\n\r\n<strong>Key Features</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>High Air Delivery Motor – Strong airflow for fast room cooling</li>\r\n 	<li>Slim Tower Design – Space-saving and modern look</li>\r\n 	<li>Large Honeycomb Cooling Pads – Superior cooling performance</li>\r\n 	<li>Perfect for Homes, Shops &amp; Offices</li>\r\n 	<li>Low Power Consumption – Efficient and cost-effective</li>\r\n 	<li>Large Water Tank Capacity – Longer cooling without frequent refills</li>\r\n 	<li>Lightweight &amp; Easy to Move</li>\r\n 	<li>Quiet Operation</li>\r\n 	<li>Durable Body &amp; Easy Maintenance</li>\r\n 	<li>Availability – In Stock</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Samrat Tower Air Cooler', 'Buy the Samrat Tower Cooler for fast cooling. Slim tower design, powerful air delivery, low power consumption, and long-lasting performance. In stock.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'samrat-tower-air-cooler', '', '', '2026-01-23 22:07:33', '2026-01-23 16:37:33', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8080/wordpress/?post_type=air_cooler&#038;p=602', 0, 'air_cooler', '', 0),
(604, 1, '2025-12-07 03:11:15', '2025-12-06 21:41:15', 'BOSS Thunder-75 Tower Air Cooler is engineered for superior cooling performance with its powerful air-delivery system and energy-efficient design. Built to keep your surroundings comfortable even during peak summer heat, this room cooler is perfect for bedrooms, living rooms, offices, shops, and small commercial spaces.\r\n\r\nEquipped with a high-performance motor, durable fan blades, and a large water tank, the BOSS Cooler ensures long hours of uninterrupted cooling. Its lightweight and portable design allows easy movement, while the strong airflow makes it ideal for both dry and humid climates. Designed with low noise and minimal power consumption, this cooler offers maximum comfort without increasing your electricity bill.\r\n\r\nWhether you\'re searching for a budget-friendly room cooler, high-airflow personal cooler, or a durable summer cooling solution, the BOSS Thunder-75 Tower Air Cooler is a reliable and long-lasting choice.\r\n\r\n<strong>Key Features</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Powerful air delivery for fast and consistent cooling</li>\r\n 	<li>Energy-efficient motor for reduced electricity consumption</li>\r\n 	<li>Large water tank for extended cooling hours</li>\r\n 	<li>Lightweight, portable &amp; easy to move</li>\r\n 	<li>Durable body with long-lasting build quality</li>\r\n 	<li>Ideal for homes, offices, shops, and small commercial spaces</li>\r\n 	<li>Low-noise cooling technology</li>\r\n</ul>', 'BOSS Thunder-75 Tower Air Cooler', 'Stay cool with the BOSS Thunder-75 Tower Air Cooler, designed for powerful air delivery, low electricity consumption, and efficient room cooling. Ideal for homes, shops, offices, and small halls, this cooler ensures consistent airflow, quiet performance, and high durability.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'boss-thunder-75-tower-air-cooler', '', '', '2026-02-26 22:12:35', '2026-02-26 16:42:35', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8080/wordpress/?post_type=air_cooler&#038;p