(610, 1, '2025-12-07 03:21:56', '2025-12-06 21:51:56', 'Stay cool even in peak summer with the Anand Flapee King Air Cooler, engineered for superior performance and long-lasting cooling. Designed with a high-airflow motor, expanded cooling pads, and a large water storage system, this cooler ensures deep and consistent cooling for hours.\r\n\r\nThe Flapee King features a heavy-duty, long-life motor that consumes less electricity while delivering maximum air throw across the room. Its strong and durable construction makes it suitable for both home and commercial spaces like shops, workshops, offices, and small halls.\r\n\r\nWith its efficient cooling technology, easy mobility, premium build, and low noise levels, the Anand Flapee King Air Cooler is a reliable choice for users who want powerful and economical cooling all summer long.\r\n\r\n<strong>Key Features</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>High-airflow motor for fast and powerful cooling</li>\r\n 	<li>Large water tank for extended usage</li>\r\n 	<li>Wide air throw for bigger room coverage</li>\r\n 	<li>Heavy-duty, energy-efficient motor</li>\r\n 	<li>Durable cooler body with long service life</li>\r\n 	<li>High-quality cooling pads for improved cooling efficiency</li>\r\n 	<li>Smooth wheels for easy movement</li>\r\n 	<li>Perfect for homes, offices, shops, and commercial areas</li>\r\n 	<li>Low-noise operation</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Anand Flapee King Air Cooler', 'The Anand Flapee King Air Cooler delivers powerful cooling with its high-speed air throw, large tank, and durable body design. Ideal for homes, shops, offices, and medium to large rooms.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'anand-flapee-king-air-cooler', '', '', '2026-01-23 22:04:39', '2026-01-23 16:34:39', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8080/wordpress/?post_type=air_cooler&#038;p=610', 0, 'air_cooler', '', 0),
(612, 1, '2025-12-07 03:23:44', '2025-12-06 21:53:44', 'Anand Jeo Tower Air Cooler offier summer comfort with the sleek and powerful cooling solution. Designed for modern homes and offices, this tower cooler provides high air delivery, efficient cooling, and whisper-quiet performance in a compact vertical design that fits easily in any space.\r\n\r\nThe Anand Jeo Tower Cooler features advanced cooling pads, a high-speed blower, and an energy-efficient motor, ensuring refreshing air circulation even during peak heat. Its tall, slim build allows wider air throw while occupying very little floor space.\r\n\r\nPerfect for bedrooms, living rooms, shops, offices, and study areas, the Jeo Tower Cooler combines aesthetics, performance, and convenience. With its lightweight construction, smooth castor wheels, and large tank capacity, it offers long-lasting cooling with minimal noise and low power usage.\r\n\r\n<strong>Key Features</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Stylish Tower Design with space-saving profile</li>\r\n 	<li>High-speed blower for strong airflow</li>\r\n 	<li>Efficient cooling pads for fast cooling</li>\r\n 	<li>Energy-efficient motor with low electricity use</li>\r\n 	<li>Large water tank for extended cooling duration</li>\r\n 	<li>Whisper-quiet operation for peaceful environments</li>\r\n 	<li>Smooth castor wheels for easy mobility</li>\r\n 	<li>Ideal for bedrooms, offices, shops, and small–medium rooms</li>\r\n 	<li>Durable body with long service life</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Anand Jeo Tower Air Cooler', 'Anand Jeo Tower Air Cooler is a stylish and compact tower-style cooler offering powerful airflow, fast cooling, and low power consumption—perfect for homes, bedrooms, offices, and small to medium-sized rooms.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'anand-jeo-tower-air-cooler', '', '', '2026-01-23 22:03:44', '2026-01-23 16:33:44', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8080/wordpress/?post_type=air_cooler&#038;p=612', 0, 'air_cooler', '', 0),
(614, 1, '2025-12-07 03:25:26', '2025-12-06 21:55:26', 'Anand Hammer Air Cooler provides superior cooling performance with the Anand Hammer Air Cooler, engineered for strong air delivery and long-lasting operation. Built with a heavy-duty design, this cooler ensures efficient cooling even during extreme summer temperatures.\r\n\r\nThe Hammer model features high-quality cooling pads, a high-speed air blower, and a large water tank, allowing longer cooling durations with minimal refilling. Its durable body construction makes it suitable for both domestic and commercial environments like living rooms, shops, offices, tailoring units, workshops, and small halls.\r\n\r\nPowered by an energy-efficient motor, the Anand Hammer Cooler provides excellent airflow coverage while keeping power consumption low. With easy mobility and low-noise performance, this cooler is a reliable cooling solution for all-day use.\r\n\r\n<strong>Key Features</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Heavy-duty air cooler with strong airflow</li>\r\n 	<li>Large water tank for long cooling hours</li>\r\n 	<li>High-speed blower for fast room cooling</li>\r\n 	<li>Durable and long-lasting body design</li>\r\n 	<li>Energy-efficient motor with low electricity use</li>\r\n 	<li>High-quality cooling pads for improved cooling efficiency</li>\r\n 	<li>Smooth wheels for easy movement</li>\r\n 	<li>Suitable for homes, offices, shops, workshops, and medium–large rooms</li>\r\n 	<li>Low-noise operation</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Anand Hammer Air Cooler', 'Anand Hammer Air Cooler provides powerful cooling with its heavy-duty motor, strong airflow, and large tank capacity — ideal for homes, shops, offices, workshops, and medium to large rooms.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'anand-hammer-air-cooler', '', '', '2026-02-26 22:10:40', '2026-02-26 16:40:40', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8080/wordpress/?post_type=air_cooler&#038;p=614', 0, 'air_cooler', '', 0),
(616, 1, '2025-12-07 03:27:15', '2025-12-06 21:57:15', 'BOSS JJR Air Cooler provide comfortably cool, and compact and efficient cooling solution built for daily use. This model features a high-speed 14-inch fan, quality cooling pads, and a sturdy motor, ensuring strong air delivery and refreshing cooling even during hot summer days.\r\n\r\nIts lightweight and portable design make it perfect for bedrooms, small offices, shops, cabins, and study rooms. Despite its compact size, the JJR 14\" provides excellent airflow and consumes minimal electricity, making it ideal for long operating hours.\r\n\r\nThe cooler is crafted with a durable body and designed to deliver low-noise performance, giving you a peaceful cooling experience. With its user-friendly operation and reliable build quality, the BOSS JJR 14\" Air Cooler is a great choice for anyone looking for an affordable and efficient air cooler.\r\n\r\n<strong>Key Features</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>High-speed 14\" fan for powerful airflow</li>\r\n 	<li>Compact and space-saving design</li>\r\n 	<li>Energy-efficient motor with low power consumption</li>\r\n 	<li>High-quality cooling pads for fast cooling</li>\r\n 	<li>Durable body construction</li>\r\n 	<li>Low-noise performance for a comfortable environment</li>\r\n 	<li>Ideal for bedrooms, small rooms, shops, and offices</li>\r\n 	<li>Lightweight and easy to move</li>\r\n</ul>', 'BOSS JJR Air Cooler', 'BOSS JJR Air Cooler is a compact yet powerful personal cooler designed for fast cooling, strong airflow, and low power consumption. Ideal for bedrooms, small rooms, shops, and offices.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'boss-jjr-air-cooler', '', '', '2026-01-23 22:01:48', '2026-01-23 16:31:48', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8080/wordpress/?post_type=air_cooler&#038;p=616', 0, 'air_cooler', '', 0),
(618, 1, '2025-12-07 03:28:38', '2025-12-06 21:58:38', 'BOSS JJR Plus Air Cooler offers better and faster cooling with the BOSS JJR 14\" Plus Air Cooler, designed with enhanced airflow technology and a more powerful motor compared to the standard JJR 14\" model. Its high-speed 14-inch fan delivers strong and refreshing airflow, making it ideal for small to medium-sized spaces.\r\n\r\nEquipped with high-quality cooling pads, a durable blower system, and a long-lasting body, the JJR 14\" Plus ensures consistent cooling performance even during peak summer heat. It is lightweight, portable, and highly energy-efficient, making it suitable for daily use in bedrooms, offices, shops, study rooms, salons, and work cabins.\r\n\r\nWith its quiet operation, strong build quality, and user-friendly design, the BOSS JJR 14\" Plus Air Cooler is the perfect combination of affordability, durability, and powerful cooling.\r\n\r\n<strong>Key Features</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>High-speed 14\" fan with enhanced airflow</li>\r\n 	<li>“Plus” model with upgraded cooling performance</li>\r\n 	<li>Energy-efficient motor for low electricity consumption</li>\r\n 	<li>Premium cooling pads for quick and effective cooling</li>\r\n 	<li>Strong and durable body construction</li>\r\n 	<li>Low-noise operation for comfortable use</li>\r\n 	<li>Lightweight and easy to move</li>\r\n 	<li>Ideal for bedrooms, work cabins, offices, small shops, and personal spaces</li>\r\n</ul>', 'BOSS JJR Plus Air Cooler', 'BOSS JJR Plus Air Cooler offers upgraded cooling performance with its high-speed 14-inch fan, improved cooling pads, and low power consumption. Perfect for bedrooms, small rooms, shops, and office cabins.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'boss-jjr-plus-air-cooler', '', '', '2026-01-23 22:01:12', '2026-01-23 16:31:12', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8080/wordpress/?post_type=air_cooler&#038;p=618', 0, 'air_cooler', '', 0),
(620, 1, '2025-12-07 03:30:32', '2025-12-06 22:00:32', 'Anand RAMKING Industrial Air Cooler is a powerful and reliable cooling solution designed specifically for factories, workshops, warehouses, commercial spaces, and large industrial environments. Built with a heavy-duty body and high-performance components, this cooler delivers exceptional airflow, maximum cooling efficiency, and long-lasting durability even in extreme working conditions. Whether you run a manufacturing unit, a fabrication workshop, a garage, or a large commercial facility, the Anand RAMKING Industrial Cooler ensures that your workspace stays comfortable, productive, and safe.\r\n\r\n<strong>Superior Cooling Performance for Large Areas</strong>\r\n\r\nWhat makes the Anand RAMKING Industrial Air Cooler stand out is its high air delivery system, engineered to cool large areas quickly and evenly. The cooler is equipped with a heavy-duty fan motor that pushes a strong, high-volume airflow capable of reaching far distances. This makes it ideal for open production floors, machine rooms, loading docks, large halls, and locations with continuous heat generation from machines and equipment.\r\n\r\nThanks to its advanced air throw technology, this industrial cooler maintains consistent cooling throughout the space, improving worker comfort and overall efficiency.\r\n\r\n<strong>Heavy-Duty Construction for Industrial Use</strong>\r\n\r\nThe Anand RAMKING Industrial Cooler is designed with robust industrial-grade materials that can withstand dust, heat, and continuous operation. The body is crafted from high-quality, high-strength plastic or metal (depending on the variant), ensuring long service life even in tough environments. Its durable construction prevents rust, dents, and cracks, making it a low-maintenance cooling solution for long-term use.\r\n\r\nFactories and workshops often face challenges like dust, vibration, and continuous running hours—but this cooler is built exactly for such conditions. It operates smoothly, reliably, and efficiently without temperature fluctuations.\r\n\r\n<strong>Large Water Tank for Long Hours of Cooling</strong>\r\n\r\nOne of the biggest advantages of the Anand RAMKING Industrial Air Cooler is its extra-large water tank capacity, allowing the cooler to operate for long hours without frequent refills. This is a huge benefit for industries that require continuous cooling throughout the day.\r\n\r\n<strong>The large tank ensures:</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Uninterrupted cooling for long shifts</li>\r\n 	<li>Reduced need for manual monitoring</li>\r\n 	<li>Stable water supply to the cooling pads</li>\r\n 	<li>Efficient cooling even during peak temperature hours</li>\r\n 	<li>Depending on usage, the cooler can run for many hours on a single fill — perfect for factories, warehouses, and commercial units.</li>\r\n 	<li>Honeycomb Cooling Pads for Maximum Efficiency</li>\r\n 	<li>The cooler features high-performance honeycomb pads that provide superior water retention and improved airflow. These pads absorb water quickly and allow efficient evaporation, resulting in cooler air output and a refreshing breeze. Honeycomb pads also last longer compared to traditional wood wool pads, making the cooler more cost-effective and maintenance friendly.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<strong>High Air Delivery with Powerful Motor</strong>\r\n\r\nThe Anand RAMKING Industrial Cooler is equipped with a heavy-duty motor designed for long operational hours. Its high-speed motor ensures:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Strong air throw</li>\r\n 	<li>Wide cooling coverage</li>\r\n 	<li>Stable and smooth performance</li>\r\n 	<li>Energy-efficient operation</li>\r\n 	<li>This makes the cooler ideal for large areas where powerful airflow is essential.</li>\r\n 	<li>Easy Mobility and User-Friendly Design</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nDespite its large size, the cooler is designed for easy movement. Equipped with durable caster wheels, it can be moved around the workspace without any difficulty. The control panel is simple and user-friendly, allowing workers to adjust speed, cooling, and water levels with ease.\r\n\r\n<strong>Energy Efficient &amp; Cost Effective</strong>\r\n\r\nCompared to industrial air conditioning systems, the Anand RAMKING Industrial Cooler consumes significantly less electricity. Businesses can enjoy highly effective cooling without worrying about rising energy costs. It is one of the most economical options for cooling large workspaces.\r\n\r\n<strong>Ideal For</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Factories &amp; manufacturing units</li>\r\n 	<li>Workshops &amp; garages</li>\r\n 	<li>Large halls &amp; event spaces</li>\r\n 	<li>Warehouses &amp; storage rooms</li>\r\n 	<li>Machine rooms &amp; fabrication units</li>\r\n 	<li>Schools, colleges &amp; community halls</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<strong>Why Choose Anand RAMKING Industrial Air Cooler?</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Heavy-duty construction</li>\r\n 	<li>High air delivery for large areas</li>\r\n 	<li>Extra-large water tank</li>\r\n 	<li>Long-lasting honeycomb pads</li>\r\n 	<li>Durable industrial motor</li>\r\n 	<li>Energy-efficient performance</li>\r\n 	<li>Designed for tough working conditions</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Anand RAMKING Industrial Air Cooler', 'Anand RAMKING Industrial Air Cooler is a powerful heavy-duty cooling system designed for factories, workshops, halls, warehouses, and commercial spaces. It delivers massive airflow, long cooling hours, and durable industrial-grade performance.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'anand-ramking-industrial-air-cooler', '', '', '2026-02-26 21:05:00', '2026-02-26 15:35:00', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8080/wordpress/?post_type=air_cooler&#038;p=620', 0, 'air_cooler', '', 0),
(622, 1, '2025-12-07 03:31:53', '2025-12-06 22:01:53', 'The Anand RamCool Industrial Air Cooler is designed for extreme cooling performance in demanding industrial environments. With its high-capacity airflow system, oversized cooling pads, and large water tank, it provides long-duration cooling even during peak summer heat.\r\n\r\nThe RamCool model features a robust and durable body, making it ideal for continuous use in garment factories, machine workshops, warehouses, catering halls, event spaces, commercial shops, and large rooms. Its heavy-duty, energy-efficient motor ensures maximum cooling output while keeping electricity consumption under control.\r\n\r\nEngineered with industrial-grade components and a high airflow throw, the Anand RamCool delivers fast and widespread cooling—making it perfect for keeping workers comfortable and maintaining optimal temperatures in large spaces.\r\n\r\n<strong>Key Features</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Heavy-duty industrial cooling system</li>\r\n 	<li>High air delivery for large-area coverage</li>\r\n 	<li>Extra-large water tank for extended cooling hours</li>\r\n 	<li>High-quality cooling pads for maximum evaporation</li>\r\n 	<li>Rugged body built for long-lasting industrial use</li>\r\n 	<li>Energy-efficient powerful motor</li>\r\n 	<li>Smooth mobility wheels for easy movement</li>\r\n 	<li>Ideal for factories, warehouses, workshops, halls &amp; large commercial spaces</li>\r\n 	<li>Low-noise operation for a more comfortable environment</li>\r\n 	<li>Suitable for continuous long-hour usage</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Anand RamCool Industrial Air Cooler', 'The Anand RamCool Industrial Air Cooler delivers powerful cooling for factories, workshops, warehouses, halls, and large commercial spaces. Built with a heavy-duty motor, high airflow, and a massive tank, it ensures long-lasting and efficient cooling.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'anand-ramcool-air-cooler', '', '', '2026-01-23 21:22:36', '2026-01-23 15:52:36', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8080/wordpress/?post_type=air_cooler&#038;p=622', 0, 'air_cooler', '', 0),
(624, 1, '2025-12-07 03:37:46', '2025-12-06 22:07:46', 'Sewing Machine Needles, ensure smooth and precise stitching with the Sewing Machine Needle. Made from rust-proof hardened steel, these medium-length needles feature a round eye and sharp point, making them ideal for cotton, polyester, and wool fabrics.\r\n\r\nDesigned as a universal needle type, fits most domestic automatic machines including USHA, Singer, Brother, and similar models, making it perfect for everyday stitching, quick repairs, and household tailoring tasks.\r\n\r\nEach pack contains 10 high-quality needles, ensuring you have backups ready for all your sewing projects. Manufactured in India under the PMW brand, these needles deliver reliability, durability, and smooth performance for home sewing enthusiasts.\r\n\r\n<strong>Key Features &amp; Specifications:</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Rust-proof hardened steel construction for durability</li>\r\n 	<li>Medium-length needle with round eye &amp; sharp point</li>\r\n 	<li>Universal point type fits most domestic machines</li>\r\n 	<li>Compatible with cotton, polyester, and wool fabrics</li>\r\n 	<li>Pack of 10 needles per set</li>\r\n 	<li>Brand: PMW | Model: HA x 18</li>\r\n 	<li>Country of Origin: India</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<strong>Best For:</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Domestic and automatic sewing machines</li>\r\n 	<li>Everyday stitching and quick repairs</li>\r\n 	<li>Home tailoring and small craft projects</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<strong>Purchase Details:</strong>\r\n\r\nAvailable for in-store purchase only. Visit our shop to explore a wide range of sewing accessories.', 'Sewing Machine Needles', 'High-quality sewing machine needles made from rust-proof hardened steel. Perfect for smooth, precise stitching on domestic automatic machines like USHA, Singer, Brother, and more. Pack of 10 needles.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'sewing-machine-needles', '', '', '2026-01-23 21:10:14', '2026-01-23 15:40:14', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8080/wordpress/?post_type=sewing_machine&#038;p=624', 0, 'accessory', '', 0),
(626, 1, '2025-12-07 03:40:26', '2025-12-06 22:10:26', 'Bobbins and Bobbins Case is an essential accessory for every sewing enthusiast and professional tailor. Designed to store and organize bobbins of different thread colors, this case ensures your sewing workspace stays tidy and efficient.\r\n\r\nMade from durable, lightweight material, it protects your bobbins from dust, damage, and tangling. Its compact design allows easy portability, making it ideal for home sewing, tailoring shops, and sewing workshops.\r\n\r\nWhether you use domestic machines like Singer, Brother, Usha, or industrial lockstitch machines, this bobbins case keeps your threads sorted and accessible, saving time and enhancing your sewing workflow.\r\n\r\n<strong>Key Features</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Durable storage case for bobbins of all sizes</li>\r\n 	<li>Protects threads from dust, tangling, and damage</li>\r\n 	<li>Compact, lightweight, and portable design</li>\r\n 	<li>Easy access to organized bobbins for quick sewing</li>\r\n 	<li>Compatible with domestic and industrial sewing machines</li>\r\n 	<li>Ideal for home sewing, tailoring shops, and workshops</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Bobbins and Bobbins Case', 'Keep your sewing threads organized with this Bobbins and Bobbins Case. Perfect for domestic and industrial sewing machines, it stores multiple bobbins neatly and prevents tangling, making sewing efficient and hassle-free. <strong>Note: Prices shown are indicative only. Final pricing may vary based on product size, quality, specifications, and customization.</strong>', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'bobbins-and-bobbins-case', '', '', '2026-01-19 17:24:25', '2026-01-19 11:54:25', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8080/wordpress/?post_type=sewing_machine&#038;p=626', 0, 'accessory', '', 0),
(628, 1, '2025-12-07 03:42:37', '2025-12-06 22:12:37', 'Shuttle Hook Assembly is a critical component for smooth and efficient stitch formation in sewing machines. Designed for domestic, semi-industrial, and industrial sewing machines, it guarantees accurate needle-to-thread interaction, ensuring consistent stitch quality and preventing thread breakage.\r\n\r\nMade from premium-grade metal, this assembly is durable, rust-resistant, and engineered for long-lasting use. It is compatible with most lockstitch and zig-zag sewing machines, making it ideal for tailoring shops, garment factories, and home sewing setups.\r\n\r\nReplacing a worn or damaged shuttle hook assembly improves machine performance, reduces skipped stitches, and extends the life of your sewing machine. A must-have spare for professional tailors and sewing enthusiasts alike.\r\n\r\n<strong>Key Features</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>High-quality, durable metal construction</li>\r\n 	<li>Rust-resistant for long-term use</li>\r\n 	<li>Ensures smooth stitch formation and precise thread movement</li>\r\n 	<li>Compatible with domestic and industrial sewing machines</li>\r\n 	<li>Ideal for lockstitch and zig-zag machines</li>\r\n 	<li>Prevents skipped stitches and thread breakage</li>\r\n 	<li>Essential spare part for tailors, garment units, and home sewing</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Shuttle Hook Assembly for Sewing Machines', 'High-quality Shuttle Hook Assembly for industrial and domestic sewing machines. Ensures smooth stitch formation, precise thread movement, and long-lasting performance. Compatible with a wide range of machines.\r\n<strong>Note: Prices shown are indicative only. Final pricing may vary based on product size, quality, specifications, and customization.</strong>', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'shuttle-hook-assembly', '', '', '2026-01-23 21:08:44', '2026-01-23 15:38:44', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8080/wordpress/?post_type=sewing_machine&#038;p=628', 0, 'accessory', '', 0),
(630, 1, '2025-12-07 03:44:41', '2025-12-06 22:14:41', 'Presser Foot for Sewing Machines is an essential sewing machine accessory that helps guide fabric smoothly under the needle, ensuring precise, even, and professional-quality stitches. Suitable for domestic machines like Singer, Brother, Usha, and Jack, as well as industrial lockstitch and zig-zag machines, this presser foot enhances your sewing efficiency and performance.\r\n\r\nMade from premium-grade metal, the presser foot is durable, rust-resistant, and built for long-lasting use. It is perfect for everyday sewing, quilting, embroidery, and tailoring projects, allowing seamless fabric movement without bunching or skipping stitches.\r\n\r\nWhether you are a professional tailor or a home sewing enthusiast, this high-quality presser foot is a reliable replacement or spare accessory for your sewing machine.\r\n\r\n<strong>Key Features</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Universal presser foot for domestic and industrial machines</li>\r\n 	<li>Smooth and precise fabric feeding for professional-quality stitching</li>\r\n 	<li>Durable, rust-resistant metal construction</li>\r\n 	<li>Compatible with lockstitch, zig-zag, and embroidery machines</li>\r\n 	<li>Ideal for everyday sewing, quilting, embroidery, and tailoring</li>\r\n 	<li>Easy to attach and replace</li>\r\n 	<li>Improves stitch consistency and prevents fabric bunching</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Presser Foot for Sewing Machines', 'Presser Foot for Sewing Machines, High-quality Presser Foot for domestic and industrial sewing machines. Ensures smooth fabric feeding, precise stitching, and consistent sewing performance. Compatible with most lockstitch, zig-zag, and embroidery machines. <strong>Note: Prices shown are indicative only. Final pricing may vary based on product size, quality, specifications, and customization.</strong>', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'presser-foot-for-sewing-machines-universal-replacement-sewing-accessory', '', '', '2026-01-20 17:06:22', '2026-01-20 11:36:22', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8080/wordpress/?post_type=sewing_machine&#038;p=630', 0, 'accessory', '', 0),
(632, 1, '2025-12-07 03:46:39', '2025-12-06 22:16:39', 'Feed Dog for Sewing Machines is a critical component of your sewing machine that moves fabric evenly under the needle for accurate stitching. Designed for domestic machines like Singer, Brother, Usha, Jack, and industrial lockstitch or zig-zag machines, this feed dog ensures smooth, uniform fabric feeding and improves stitch quality.\r\n\r\nMade from premium-grade metal, the feed dog is durable, rust-resistant, and engineered for long-term performance. Replacing a worn or damaged feed dog restores proper fabric movement, reduces skipped stitches, and enhances your machine’s efficiency.\r\n\r\nPerfect for tailoring shops, garment factories, quilting, embroidery, and home sewing, this high-quality replacement feed dog ensures reliable performance for all sewing tasks.\r\n\r\n<strong>Key Features</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>High-quality replacement feed dog for sewing machines</li>\r\n 	<li>Smooth and consistent fabric feeding for precise stitching</li>\r\n 	<li>Compatible with domestic and industrial machines</li>\r\n 	<li>Durable, rust-resistant metal construction</li>\r\n 	<li>Ideal for lockstitch, zig-zag, and embroidery machines</li>\r\n 	<li>Restores proper stitch formation and prevents skipped stitches</li>\r\n 	<li>Suitable for tailoring, quilting, embroidery, and home sewing</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Feed Dog for Sewing Machines', 'High-quality Feed Dog ensures smooth and consistent fabric movement in domestic and industrial sewing machines. Ideal for lockstitch, zig-zag, and embroidery machines. Durable, precise, and long-lasting.\r\n<strong>Note: Prices shown are indicative only. Final pricing may vary based on product size, quality, specifications, and customization.</strong>', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'feed-dog-for-sewing-machines', '', '', '2026-01-19 14:42:31', '2026-01-19 09:12:31', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8080/wordpress/?post_type=sewing_machine&#038;p=632', 0, 'accessory', '', 0),
(634, 1, '2025-12-07 03:48:21', '2025-12-06 22:18:21', 'Throat or Needle Plate is an essential component of a sewing machine, providing a flat and stable surface for fabric while guiding the needle for accurate stitch formation. Designed for domestic machines like Singer, Brother, Usha, and Jack, as well as industrial lockstitch and zig-zag machines, it ensures smooth fabric feeding, proper needle alignment, and consistent stitching quality.\r\n\r\nMade from premium-grade metal, the needle plate is durable, rust-resistant, and built to withstand heavy use. Replacing a worn or damaged needle plate prevents skipped stitches, needle bending, and fabric damage, improving your sewing machine’s performance.\r\n\r\nIdeal for home sewing, tailoring, embroidery, quilting, and garment production, this high-quality replacement part ensures professional results every time.\r\n\r\n<strong>Key Features</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Durable throat / needle plate for sewing machines</li>\r\n 	<li>Ensures smooth needle movement and precise stitch formation</li>\r\n 	<li>Compatible with domestic and industrial sewing machines</li>\r\n 	<li>Rust-resistant, premium-grade metal construction</li>\r\n 	<li>Suitable for lockstitch, zig-zag, and embroidery machines</li>\r\n 	<li>Prevents skipped stitches, needle bending, and fabric damage</li>\r\n 	<li>Ideal for home sewing, tailoring, quilting, and embroidery projects</li>\r\n 	<li>Easy to install and replace</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Throat or Needle Plate for Sewing Machines', 'High-quality Throat / Needle Plate ensures smooth needle movement and precise stitching in domestic and industrial sewing machines. Compatible with most lockstitch, zig-zag, and embroidery machines.\r\n<strong>Note: Prices shown are indicative only. Final pricing may vary based on product size, quality, specifications, and customization.</strong>', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'throat-or-needle-plate', '', '', '2026-01-23 20:32:52', '2026-01-23 15:02:52', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8080/wordpress/?post_type=sewing_machine&#038;p=634', 0, 'accessory', '', 0),
(636, 1, '2025-12-07 03:50:42', '2025-12-06 22:20:42', 'Tension Assembly is a vital sewing machine component that controls the tightness of the thread, ensuring smooth, uniform stitches and preventing loose or puckered seams. Compatible with domestic machines like Singer, Brother, Usha, Jack, as well as industrial lockstitch and zig-zag machines, this tension assembly is suitable for a wide range of sewing applications.\r\n\r\nCrafted from premium-grade materials, the tension assembly is durable, rust-resistant, and designed for long-lasting performance. Proper tension adjustment prevents thread breakage, skipped stitches, and uneven seams, improving both machine efficiency and stitch quality.\r\n\r\nIdeal for tailoring shops, garment factories, embroidery, quilting, and home sewing, this high-quality tension assembly guarantees reliable and professional results for all your sewing projects.\r\n\r\n<strong>Key Features</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Adjustable tension assembly for consistent stitch quality</li>\r\n 	<li>Compatible with domestic and industrial sewing machines</li>\r\n 	<li>Controls thread tightness to prevent loose or puckered seams</li>\r\n 	<li>Durable and rust-resistant construction</li>\r\n 	<li>Suitable for lockstitch, zig-zag, and embroidery machines</li>\r\n 	<li>Prevents thread breakage and skipped stitches</li>\r\n 	<li>Ideal for home sewing, tailoring, quilting, and garment production</li>\r\n 	<li>Easy to install and replace</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Tension Assembly for Sewing Machines', 'High-quality Tension Assembly for domestic and industrial sewing machines. Ensures proper thread tension, smooth stitching, and consistent stitch quality. Compatible with lockstitch, zig-zag, and embroidery machines.\r\n<strong>Note: Prices shown are indicative only. Final pricing may vary based on product size, quality, specifications, and customization.</strong>', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'tension-assembly', '', '', '2026-01-23 20:31:21', '2026-01-23 15:01:21', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8080/wordpress/?post_type=sewing_machine&#038;p=636', 0, 'accessory', '', 0),
(638, 1, '2025-12-07 03:52:47', '2025-12-06 22:22:47', 'Drive Belt - V-Belt  is an essential sewing machine component responsible for transmitting power from the motor to the sewing mechanism, enabling smooth needle movement and consistent stitch formation. Compatible with domestic machines like Singer, Brother, Usha, as well as industrial lockstitch and zig-zag machines, it ensures reliable performance and reduces machine wear.\r\n\r\nManufactured from premium-grade rubber and reinforced materials, the belt is durable, flexible, and built to withstand prolonged use. A high-quality drive belt reduces slippage, vibration, and noise, improving machine efficiency and longevity.\r\n\r\nPerfect for tailoring shops, garment factories, embroidery, quilting, and home sewing, this V-belt is a reliable replacement part for maintaining the optimal performance of your sewing machine.\r\n\r\n<strong>Key Features</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Durable drive belt / V-belt for sewing machines</li>\r\n 	<li>Ensures smooth power transmission and consistent stitching</li>\r\n 	<li>Compatible with domestic and industrial sewing machines</li>\r\n 	<li>Made from premium-grade rubber for long-lasting use</li>\r\n 	<li>Reduces slippage, vibration, and operational noise</li>\r\n 	<li>Suitable for lockstitch, zig-zag, and embroidery machines</li>\r\n 	<li>Ideal for tailoring shops, home sewing, quilting, and garment production</li>\r\n 	<li>Easy to replace and maintain</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Drive Belt - V-Belt for Sewing Machines', 'High-quality Drive Belt / V-Belt ensures smooth power transmission and efficient operation in domestic and industrial sewing machines. Durable, long-lasting, and compatible with most lockstitch and zig-zag machines.\r\n<strong>Note: Prices shown are indicative only. Final pricing may vary based on product size, quality, specifications, and customization.</strong>', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'drive-belt-v-belt-for-sewing-machines', '', '', '2026-01-17 17:24:41', '2