(644, 1, '2025-12-07 02:59:01', '2025-12-06 21:29:01', 'Hand Wheel and Balance Wheel is an essential component of a sewing machine, allowing users to manually control needle movement and stitch formation. Compatible with domestic machines like Singer, Brother, Usha, as well as industrial lockstitch and zig-zag machines, it ensures precise stitching and reliable operation.\r\n\r\nManufactured from premium-grade metal, the hand wheel is durable, rust-resistant, and built to withstand prolonged use. It helps regulate machine speed manually, making it easier to start stitching accurately, work on delicate fabrics, or adjust machine settings during maintenance.\r\n\r\nIdeal for tailoring shops, garment factories, home sewing, quilting, and embroidery units, this hand wheel is a must-have replacement for smooth sewing machine operation.\r\n\r\n<strong>Key Features</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>High-quality hand wheel / balance wheel for sewing machines</li>\r\n 	<li>Smooth manual control for needle and stitch movement</li>\r\n 	<li>Durable and rust-resistant construction</li>\r\n 	<li>Compatible with domestic and industrial machines</li>\r\n 	<li>Suitable for lockstitch, zig-zag, and embroidery machines</li>\r\n 	<li>Improves stitch precision and machine control</li>\r\n 	<li>Ideal for home sewing, tailoring shops, garment factories, and embroidery units</li>\r\n 	<li>Easy to install and maintain</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Hand Wheel and Balance Wheel for Sewing Machines', 'High-quality Hand Wheel and Balance Wheel for domestic and industrial sewing machines. Ensures smooth manual operation, precise stitch control, and reliable performance for lockstitch, zig-zag, and embroidery machines.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'hand-wheel-and-balance-wheel', '', '', '2026-01-19 23:11:10', '2026-01-19 17:41:10', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8080/wordpress/?post_type=sewing_machine&#038;p=644', 0, 'accessory', '', 0),
(646, 1, '2025-12-07 03:00:37', '2025-12-06 21:30:37', 'Take-Up Lever is a crucial sewing machine component that guides thread from the spool to the needle, ensuring consistent stitch formation and proper tension. Compatible with domestic machines like Singer, Brother, Usha, and industrial lockstitch and zig-zag machines, this lever helps prevent skipped stitches and thread breakage.\r\n\r\nMade from premium-grade metal, the take-up lever is durable, rust-resistant, and designed for long-term use. Replacing a worn or damaged lever restores smooth thread movement, improves stitch quality, and ensures reliable machine performance.\r\n\r\nIdeal for tailoring shops, garment factories, home sewing, quilting, and embroidery projects, this take-up lever is an essential replacement part for professional-quality stitching.\r\n\r\n<strong>Key Features</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>High-quality take-up lever for sewing machines</li>\r\n 	<li>Ensures proper thread tension and smooth stitch formation</li>\r\n 	<li>Durable, rust-resistant metal construction</li>\r\n 	<li>Compatible with domestic and industrial machines</li>\r\n 	<li>Suitable for lockstitch, zig-zag, and embroidery machines</li>\r\n 	<li>Prevents skipped stitches and thread breakage</li>\r\n 	<li>Ideal for home sewing, tailoring shops, quilting, and embroidery</li>\r\n 	<li>Easy to install and maintain</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Take-Up Lever for Sewing Machines', 'High-quality Take-Up Lever for domestic and industrial sewing machines. Ensures proper thread tension, smooth stitch formation, and consistent sewing performance.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'take-up-lever', '', '', '2026-01-19 23:10:59', '2026-01-19 17:40:59', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8080/wordpress/?post_type=sewing_machine&#038;p=646', 0, 'accessory', '', 0),
(648, 1, '2025-12-07 03:02:09', '2025-12-06 21:32:09', 'Needle Bar and Presser Bar are essential components of any sewing machine, providing accurate needle positioning and stable presser foot movement. Compatible with domestic machines like Singer, Brother, Usha, as well as industrial lockstitch and zig-zag machines, these bars ensure smooth operation, consistent stitch quality, and reduced fabric bunching.\r\n\r\nCrafted from premium-grade, durable metal, both the needle bar and presser bar are rust-resistant and designed to withstand long-term use. Replacing worn or damaged bars restores proper needle and presser foot alignment, enhances stitch consistency, and improves overall machine performance.\r\n\r\nIdeal for tailoring shops, garment factories, embroidery units, quilting, and home sewing, these replacement parts are a must-have for professional-quality stitching.\r\n\r\n<strong>Key Features</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Durable needle bar &amp; presser bar for sewing machines</li>\r\n 	<li>Ensures precise needle and presser foot movement</li>\r\n 	<li>Rust-resistant, premium-grade metal construction</li>\r\n 	<li>Compatible with domestic and industrial machines</li>\r\n 	<li>Suitable for lockstitch, zig-zag, and embroidery machines</li>\r\n 	<li>Prevents skipped stitches and fabric bunching</li>\r\n 	<li>Ideal for home sewing, tailoring shops, garment factories, and embroidery</li>\r\n 	<li>Easy to install and maintain</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Needle Bar and Presser Bar for Sewing Machines', 'High-quality Needle Bar and Presser Bar for domestic and industrial sewing machines. Ensures precise needle and presser foot movement, smooth stitching, and consistent sewing performance.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'needle-bar-and-presser-bar', '', '', '2026-01-19 23:10:52', '2026-01-19 17:40:52', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8080/wordpress/?post_type=sewing_machine&#038;p=648', 0, 'accessory', '', 0),
(650, 1, '2025-12-07 03:03:47', '2025-12-06 21:33:47', '<strong>Stand and Table Set for Sewing Machines</strong>\r\n\r\nStand and Table Set is an essential accessory for any sewing setup, providing a stable, ergonomic, and durable surface for domestic and industrial sewing machines. Designed to support both lockstitch and zig-zag machines, this table set ensures smooth machine operation and an organized sewing workspace.\r\n\r\nMade from premium-quality materials, the stand/table set is strong, rust-resistant, and built for long-term use. Its design allows for comfortable sewing posture, easy movement, and safe placement of the machine, making it ideal for tailoring shops, garment factories, quilting, embroidery units, and home sewing setups.\r\n\r\nWith this stand/table set, you can maximize productivity, maintain proper machine alignment, and ensure consistent, professional-quality stitching for all your sewing projects.\r\n\r\n<strong>Key Features</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Durable sewing machine stand / table set</li>\r\n 	<li>Supports domestic and industrial sewing machines</li>\r\n 	<li>Stable and ergonomic design for comfortable operation</li>\r\n 	<li>Rust-resistant and long-lasting construction</li>\r\n 	<li>Suitable for lockstitch, zig-zag, and embroidery machines</li>\r\n 	<li>Provides an organized and safe sewing workspace</li>\r\n 	<li>Ideal for tailoring shops, garment factories, quilting, embroidery, and home sewing</li>\r\n 	<li>Easy to assemble and maintain</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Stand and Table Set for Sewing Machine', 'High-quality Sewing Machine Stand and Table Set designed for stability, comfort, and efficiency. Suitable for domestic and industrial sewing machines, ensuring smooth operation and organized workspace.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'stand-and-table-set', '', '', '2026-01-19 23:10:37', '2026-01-19 17:40:37', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8080/wordpress/?post_type=sewing_machine&#038;p=650', 0, 'accessory', '', 0),
(652, 1, '2025-12-07 03:05:09', '2025-12-06 21:35:09', 'Bobbin Winder Assembly is a vital sewing machine component that enables efficient and precise winding of thread onto bobbins. Compatible with domestic machines like Singer, Brother, Usha, as well as industrial lockstitch and zig-zag machines, it ensures smooth bobbin preparation for uninterrupted stitching.\r\n\r\nMade from premium-grade materials, this assembly is durable, rust-resistant, and built for long-term use. Replacing a worn or damaged bobbin winder assembly ensures proper thread tension on the bobbin, prevents thread tangling, and enhances overall machine performance.\r\n\r\nIdeal for tailoring shops, garment factories, embroidery units, quilting, and home sewing, the bobbin winder assembly is an essential spare part for professional-quality sewing.\r\n\r\n<strong>Key Features</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>High-quality bobbin winder assembly for sewing machines</li>\r\n 	<li>Ensures smooth and consistent bobbin winding</li>\r\n 	<li>Durable, rust-resistant construction for long-lasting use</li>\r\n 	<li>Compatible with domestic and industrial machines</li>\r\n 	<li>Suitable for lockstitch, zig-zag, and embroidery machines</li>\r\n 	<li>Prevents thread tangling and maintains proper bobbin tension</li>\r\n 	<li>Ideal for home sewing, tailoring shops, garment factories, and embroidery units</li>\r\n 	<li>Easy to install and maintain</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Bobbin Winder Assembly for Sewing Machines', 'High-quality Bobbin Winder Assembly for domestic and industrial sewing machines. Ensures smooth, consistent bobbin winding and improves overall sewing efficiency.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'bobbin-winder-assembly', '', '', '2026-01-19 23:10:27', '2026-01-19 17:40:27', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8080/wordpress/?post_type=sewing_machine&#038;p=652', 0, 'accessory', '', 0),
(654, 1, '2025-12-07 03:08:28', '2025-12-06 21:38:28', '<h5><strong>Cooling Pads for Air Coolers</strong></h5>\r\nUpgrade your air cooler’s performance with premium Cooling Pads in Honeycomb, Aspen, and Wood Wool types. Designed to maximize evaporative cooling efficiency, these pads ensure optimal airflow, lower temperatures, and enhanced indoor comfort.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Honeycomb Pads:</strong> Durable and high-efficiency pads providing uniform water distribution for better cooling. Ideal for industrial and desert coolers.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Aspen Pads:</strong> Natural cellulose pads that absorb water effectively, delivering long-lasting cooling for residential and commercial air coolers.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Wood Wool Pads:</strong> Traditional cooling pads made from wood fibers, offering cost-effective and reliable performance for smaller coolers.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nAll cooling pads are durable, easy to install, and designed for long-term use. Perfect for home air coolers, tower coolers, desert coolers, and industrial units, these pads improve cooling efficiency, reduce energy consumption, and provide a refreshing indoor environment.\r\n<h5><strong>Key Features</strong></h5>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>High-quality cooling pads for all types of air coolers</li>\r\n 	<li>Available in Honeycomb, Aspen, and Wood Wool varieties</li>\r\n 	<li>Improves evaporative cooling efficiency and airflow</li>\r\n 	<li>Durable, long-lasting, and easy to install</li>\r\n 	<li>Suitable for residential, commercial, and industrial air coolers</li>\r\n 	<li>Reduces energy consumption while enhancing cooling</li>\r\n 	<li>Ideal for tower coolers, desert coolers, and room coolers</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Cooling Pads for Air Coolers', 'High-quality cooling pads for air coolers, available in Honeycomb, Aspen, and Wood Wool varieties. Enhance airflow, maximize cooling efficiency, and improve indoor comfort for homes, offices, and industrial spaces.\r\n<strong>Prices shown are indicative only. Final pricing may vary based on product size, quality, specifications, and customization.</strong>', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'cooling-pads-for-air-coolers', '', '', '2026-01-19 23:10:15', '2026-01-19 17:40:15', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8080/wordpress/?post_type=air_cooler&#038;p=654', 0, 'accessory', '', 0),
(656, 1, '2025-12-07 03:10:13', '2025-12-06 21:40:13', 'Pump Motor for Air Coolers is an essential component that ensures smooth water circulation over cooling pads, maximizing cooling efficiency and performance. Designed for residential, tower, and industrial air coolers, this pump motor is built to withstand continuous operation and deliver reliable performance.\r\n\r\nMade from premium-grade materials, it is durable, energy-efficient, and rust-resistant, providing long-term operation with minimal maintenance. Replacing a worn or damaged pump motor improves water flow, enhances cooling efficiency, and extends the life of your air cooler.\r\n\r\nIdeal for home air coolers, tower coolers, desert coolers, and industrial units, this pump motor guarantees optimal cooling performance and consistent indoor comfort.\r\n\r\n<strong>Key Features</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Durable pump motor for all types of air coolers</li>\r\n 	<li>Ensures smooth water circulation over cooling pads</li>\r\n 	<li>Compatible with residential, tower, and industrial coolers</li>\r\n 	<li>Rust-resistant, energy-efficient, and long-lasting construction</li>\r\n 	<li>Improves cooling efficiency and reduces energy consumption</li>\r\n 	<li>Easy to install and maintain</li>\r\n 	<li>Ideal for home, commercial, and industrial air cooler units</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Pump Motor for Air Coolers', 'High-quality Pump Motor for air coolers ensures consistent water circulation, efficient cooling, and long-lasting performance. Compatible with residential, tower, and industrial air coolers.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'pump-motor-for-air-coolers', '', '', '2026-01-19 23:09:45', '2026-01-19 17:39:45', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8080/wordpress/?post_type=air_cooler&#038;p=656', 0, 'accessory', '', 0),
(658, 1, '2025-12-07 03:11:47', '2025-12-06 21:41:47', '<strong>Fan Blades for Air Cooler Universal Size</strong>\r\n\r\nUpgrade your air cooler’s efficiency with premium Fan Blades designed for optimal airflow and enhanced cooling performance. Available in 12”, 14”, and 16” sizes, these blades are compatible with a wide range of residential, tower, and industrial air coolers.\r\n\r\nMade from durable, lightweight, and corrosion-resistant materials, these fan blades are engineered to withstand continuous operation while maintaining balanced rotation and minimal noise. Replacing old or damaged blades improves air circulation, reduces energy consumption, and enhances overall cooling efficiency.\r\n\r\nPerfect for home air coolers, desert coolers, tower coolers, and industrial units, these high-quality fan blades ensure consistent and effective cooling throughout the room or workspace.\r\n\r\n<strong>Key Features</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Available in 12”, 14”, and 16” sizes for various air coolers</li>\r\n 	<li>Durable, lightweight, and corrosion-resistant construction</li>\r\n 	<li>Ensures optimal airflow and improved cooling efficiency</li>\r\n 	<li>Compatible with residential, tower, and industrial air coolers</li>\r\n 	<li>Reduces noise and energy consumption during operation</li>\r\n 	<li>Easy to replace and maintain</li>\r\n 	<li>Ideal for home, office, and industrial cooling applications</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Fan Blades for Air Cooler', 'High-quality Fan Blades for air coolers, available in 12”, 14”, and 16” sizes. Ensures efficient airflow, improved cooling performance, and long-lasting operation for residential, tower, and industrial air coolers.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'fan-blades-for-air-cooler', '', '', '2026-01-19 23:09:34', '2026-01-19 17:39:34', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8080/wordpress/?post_type=air_cooler&#038;p=658', 0, 'accessory', '', 0),
(660, 1, '2025-12-07 03:13:40', '2025-12-06 21:43:40', 'Swing Motor for Air Coolers is an essential component that controls the oscillation of the cooler’s fan, ensuring uniform airflow across the room for consistent cooling. Designed for residential, tower, and industrial air coolers, this motor guarantees smooth and reliable operation.\r\n\r\nConstructed from premium-grade materials, the swing motor is durable, energy-efficient, and rust-resistant. Replacing a worn or faulty swing motor restores proper fan oscillation, improves cooling distribution, and enhances overall comfort.\r\n\r\nIdeal for home air coolers, desert coolers, tower coolers, and industrial units, this swing motor is a reliable spare part for maintaining optimal performance and even air circulation in any environment.\r\n\r\n<strong>Key Features</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Durable swing motor for smooth oscillation</li>\r\n 	<li>Ensures even air distribution for optimal cooling</li>\r\n 	<li>Compatible with residential, tower, and industrial air coolers</li>\r\n 	<li>Rust-resistant, energy-efficient, and long-lasting construction</li>\r\n 	<li>Reduces noise and improves operational efficiency</li>\r\n 	<li>Easy to install and maintain</li>\r\n 	<li>Ideal for home, office, and industrial cooling applications</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Swing Motor for Air Coolers', 'High-quality Swing Motor for air coolers ensures smooth oscillation and even air distribution. Compatible with tower, room, and industrial air coolers, built for long-lasting performance.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'swing-motor-for-air-coolers', '', '', '2026-01-19 23:09:19', '2026-01-19 17:39:19', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8080/wordpress/?post_type=air_cooler&#038;p=660', 0, 'accessory', '', 0),
(662, 1, '2025-12-07 03:15:17', '2025-12-06 21:45:17', 'Air Cooler Switch Panel is a critical component that allows you to control fan speed, swing, and cooling functions of your air cooler with ease. Designed for residential, tower, and industrial coolers, this panel ensures smooth, reliable operation of all cooler settings.\r\n\r\nMade from premium-quality, durable materials, the switch panel is resistant to wear and tear and provides long-lasting performance. Replacing a faulty or damaged panel restores full control over your cooler, improves usability, and enhances your indoor cooling experience.\r\n\r\nIdeal for home air coolers, desert coolers, tower coolers, and industrial units, this replacement switch panel ensures convenient operation and improved cooling efficiency.\r\n\r\n<strong>Key Features</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Durable replacement switch panel for air coolers</li>\r\n 	<li>Controls fan speed, swing, and cooling functions</li>\r\n 	<li>Compatible with residential, tower, and industrial air coolers</li>\r\n 	<li>Made from premium, long-lasting materials</li>\r\n 	<li>Restores proper cooler functionality and control</li>\r\n 	<li>Easy to install and maintain</li>\r\n 	<li>Ideal for home, office, and industrial cooling setups</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Air Cooler Switch Panel', 'High-quality Air Cooler Switch Panel for air coolers, enabling smooth control of speed, swing, and other functions. Compatible with tower, room, and industrial air coolers.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'air-cooler-switch-panel', '', '', '2026-01-19 23:06:02', '2026-01-19 17:36:02', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8080/wordpress/?post_type=air_cooler&#038;p=662', 0, 'accessory', '', 0),
(664, 1, '2025-12-07 03:16:49', '2025-12-06 21:46:49', 'Knobs and Regulators are essential accessories for controlling the fan speed, swing, and cooling settings of your air cooler. Designed for home, tower, and industrial air coolers, these knobs and regulators allow smooth, precise operation and enhance the usability of your cooler.\r\n\r\nMade from durable, premium-quality materials, these replacement parts are built to withstand frequent use and ensure long-lasting performance. Replacing damaged or worn knobs and regulators restores full functionality, improves user convenience, and maintains optimal cooler performance.\r\n\r\nPerfect for residential rooms, offices, tailoring shops, and industrial units, these accessories ensure reliable operation and efficient indoor cooling.\r\n\r\n<strong>Key Features</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Durable replacement knobs and regulators for air coolers</li>\r\n 	<li>Allows precise control of fan speed, swing, and cooling functions</li>\r\n 	<li>Compatible with residential, tower, and industrial air coolers</li>\r\n 	<li>Made from high-quality, long-lasting materials</li>\r\n 	<li>Restores proper control and functionality of your cooler</li>\r\n 	<li>Easy to install and maintain</li>\r\n 	<li>Ideal for home, office, and industrial cooling applications</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Knobs and Regulators', 'High-quality Cooler Knobs and Regulators for air coolers, enabling precise control of speed, swing, and cooling functions. Compatible with residential, tower, and industrial air coolers.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'knobs-and-regulators', '', '', '2026-01-19 22:58:37', '2026-01-19 17:28:37', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8080/wordpress/?post_type=air_cooler&#038;p=664', 0, 'accessory', '', 0),
(666, 1, '2025-12-07 03:18:41', '2025-12-06 21:48:41', 'Water Level Indicators is an essential accessory for air coolers that helps you monitor and maintain the correct water level in the cooler tank. Compatible with home, tower, and industrial air coolers, it ensures uninterrupted cooling and prevents damage caused by low water levels.\r\n\r\nMade from premium-quality, durable materials, this indicator is long-lasting, corrosion-resistant, and easy to install. Replacing a faulty or broken water level indicator ensures proper water management, improves cooler efficiency, and extends the life of your cooler.\r\n\r\nIdeal for residential rooms, offices, tailoring shops, and industrial units, this water level indicator guarantees safe, reliable, and efficient cooling throughout its use.\r\n\r\n<strong>Key Features</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Durable water level indicator for air coolers</li>\r\n 	<li>Monitors water levels accurately to prevent dry running</li>\r\n 	<li>Compatible with residential, tower, and industrial air coolers</li>\r\n 	<li>Made from high-quality, long-lasting, and corrosion-resistant materials</li>\r\n 	<li>Improves cooler efficiency and operational safety</li>\r\n 	<li>Easy to install and maintain</li>\r\n 	<li>Ideal for home, office, and industrial cooling applications</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Water Level Indicators for Air Coolers', 'High-quality Water Level Indicators for air coolers to monitor water levels accurately. Compatible with residential, tower, and industrial air coolers, ensuring efficient operation and preventing dry running.', 'private', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'water-level-indicators', '', '', '2026-01-23 21:20:02', '2026-01-23 15:50:02', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8080/wordpress/?post_type=air_cooler&#038;p=666', 0, 'accessory', '', 0),
(668, 1, '2025-12-07 03:20:32', '2025-12-06 21:50:32', 'The Water Pipes &amp; Hose Connectors are essential accessories for air coolers, enabling smooth water circulation and proper connection between the water tank, pump, and pads. Designed for residential, tower, and industrial air coolers, these parts ensure uninterrupted cooling and prevent leakage or blockages.\r\n\r\nMade from durable, high-quality, and corrosion-resistant materials, these water pipes and connectors provide long-lasting performance. Installing these replacement parts improves water distribution, enhances cooler efficiency, and maintains consistent indoor cooling.\r\n\r\nPerfect for home air coolers, tower coolers, desert coolers, and industrial units, these accessories are ideal for maintaining the longevity and effectiveness of your cooler.\r\n\r\n<strong>Key Features</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>High-quality water pipes &amp; hose connectors for air coolers</li>\r\n 	<li>Ensures smooth water flow and proper connections</li>\r\n 	<li>Compatible with residential, tower, and industrial air coolers</li>\r\n 	<li>Made from durable, corrosion-resistant materials</li>\r\n 	<li>Improves water distribution and cooler efficiency</li>\r\n 	<li>Prevents leakage and water blockages</li>\r\n 	<li>Easy to install and maintain</li>\r\n 	<li>Ideal for home, office, and industrial air cooler units</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Water Pipes & Hose Connectors for Air Coolers', 'High-quality Water Pipes & Hose Connectors for air coolers ensure smooth water flow, reliable connections, and efficient cooling. Compatible with residential, tower, and industrial air coolers.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'water-pipes-and-hose-connectors', '', '', '2026-01-23 21:18:11', '2026-01-23 15:48:11', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8080/wordpress/?post_type=air_cooler&#038;p=668', 0, 'accessory', '', 0),
(670, 1, '2025-12-07 03:21:52', '2025-12-06 21:51:52', 'Castor Wheels and Stands are essential accessories for air coolers, providing mobility, stability, and reliable support. Designed for home, office, tower, and industrial air coolers, these parts make it easy to move your cooler while ensuring it stays securely in place during operation.\r\n\r\nConstructed from premium-grade, durable materials, these castor wheels and stands are corrosion-resistant and built for long-lasting use. Installing these replacements improves cooler portability, prevents accidental tipping, and enhances convenience for repositioning the unit.\r\n\r\nIdeal for residential rooms, offices, tailoring shops, and industrial units, these accessories ensure both safety and ease of use, making them a must-have for all air cooler setups.\r\n\r\n<strong>Key Features</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Durable castor wheels &amp; stands for air coolers</li>\r\n 	<li>Provides easy mobility and stable placement</li>\r\n 	<li>Compatible with residential, tower, and industrial air coolers</li>\r\n 	<li>Made from premium, corrosion-resistant, and long-lasting materials</li>\r\n 	<li>Prevents tipping and ensures safe operation</li>\r\n 	<li>Easy to install and maintain</li>\r\n 	<li>Ideal for home, office, and industrial air cooler units</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Castor Wheels and Stands for Air Coolers', 'High-quality Castor Wheels and Stands for air coolers, allowing easy mobility, stable placement, and secure support. Compatible with residential, tower, and industrial air coolers.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'castor-wheels-and-stands', '', '', '2026-01-23 21:13:29', '2026-01-23 15:43:29', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8080/wordpress/?post_type=air_cooler&#038;p=670', 0, 'accessory', '', 0),
(672, 1, '2025-12-07 03:23:40', '2025-12-06 21:53:40', 'Power Cords and Cables are essential electrical accessories for air coolers, providing safe, stable, and reliable power supply. Designed for residential, tower, and industrial air coolers, these cords ensure uninterrupted operation and prevent electrical hazards.\r\n\r\nMade from premium-grade, durable, and heat-resistant materials, these power cords and cables are built for long-lasting performance. Replacing worn or damaged cords improves safety, prevents short circuits, and ensures consistent cooler functionality.\r\n\r\nIdeal for home air coolers, tower coolers, desert coolers, and industrial units, these replacement power cords guarantee efficient and safe cooler operation.\r\n\r\n<strong>Key Features</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Durable power cords &amp; cables for air coolers</li>\r\n 	<li>Ensures safe and reliable electrical connections</li>\r\n 	<li>Compatible with residential, tower, and industrial air coolers</li>\r\n 	<li>Made from heat-resistant, high-quality materials</li>\r\n 	<li>Prevents electrical hazards and short circuits</li>\r\n 	<li>Easy to replace and maintain</li>\r\n 	<li>Ideal for home, office, and industrial cooler units</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Power Cords and Cables for Air Coolers', 'Power Cords and Cables, High-quality material for air coolers, ensuring safe and reliable electrical connections. Compatible with residential, tower, and industrial air coolers for uninterrupted cooling performance.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'power-cords-and-cables', '', '', '2026-01-23 21:12:37', '2026-01-23 15:42:37', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8080/wordpress/?post_type=air_cooler&#038;p=672', 0, 'accessory', '', 0),
(678, 1, '2025-12-07 18:57:18', '2025-12-07 13:27:18', '<a href=\"https://jukiindia.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Juki</a> DDL-8900D Industrial Sewing Machine is a high-performance industrial lockstitch sewing machine designed for fast, smooth, and efficient stitching. With a maximum speed of 5000 stitches per minute, this model delivers exceptional productivity for tailoring shops, boutiques, alteration centers, and garment units working with light fabrics.\r\n\r\nEngineered with a 30.7mm needle bar stroke, the Juki 8900D ensures precise stitch formation and improved penetration, reducing skipped stitches even during high-speed runs. The machine uses the popular <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/DBX1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">DBx1 needle system</a>, making it versatile across multiple light-material applications.\r\n\r\nThis model is available in both New and Second-Hand conditions, giving buyers flexibility based on budget and requirement. Renowned for its durability, smooth operation, and low maintenance, the Juki DDL-8900D remains one of the most trusted industrial lockstitch machines.\r\n\r\n<strong>Key Features</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>High-speed stitching: 5000 stitches per minute</li>\r\n 	<li>Semi-automatic industrial lockstitch machine</li>\r\n 	<li>1-needle design for precise stitching</li>\r\n 	<li>30.7mm needle bar stroke for improved accuracy</li>\r\n 	<li>Needle System: <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/DBX1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">DBx1 Needle System</a></li>\r\n 	<li>Best suited for light materials</li>\r\n 	<li>Smooth operation with low vibration</li>\r\n 	<li>Available in New and Second-Hand</li>\r\n 	<li>Long-lasting, stable, and easy to maintain</li>\r\n 	<li>Heavy-duty metal build for industrial use</li>\r\n 	<li>Brand - <a href=\"https://jukiindia.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Juki India</a></li>\r\n 	<li>In Stock – Ready for purchase</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Juki DDL-8900D Industrial Sewing Machine', 'Juki DDL-8900D Industrial Sewing Machine is a high-speed semi-automatic lockstitch sewing machine with 5000 stitches/min, 30.7mm needle bar stroke, and DBx1 needle system. Ideal for light materials. Available in new and second-hand condition.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'juki-ddl-8900d-industrial-sewing-machine', '', '', '2026-02-07 00:01:08', '2026-02-06 18:31:08', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8080/wordpress/?post_type=sewing_machine&#038;p=678', 0, 'sewing_machine', '', 0),
(684, 1, '2025-12-07 19:35:58', '2025-12-07 14:05:58', 'Best Tailoring and Stitching Services offer expert craftsmanship, precision fitting, and premium finishing for all types of men’s garments. Whether you need custom-made shirts, perfectly tailored trousers, ethnic wear, suits, blazers, uniforms, or alteration services, we provide high-quality stitching designed to enhance comfort and style.\r\n\r\nWith years of tailoring experience, we ensure professional cutting, modern patterns, and clean finishing using high-quality sewing machines and skilled workmanship. Every outfit is tailored to match your exact measurements and personal style preferences.\r\n\r\nWe specialize in daily wear, office wear, ceremonial and wedding wear, ensuring perfect fit, durability, and a refined look. Quick delivery, quality assurance, and customer satisfaction are our top priorities.\r\n\r\n<strong>Key Features</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Professional stitching for all men’s garments</li>\r\n 	<li>Custom fitting for shirts, pants, suits, kurta-pyjama, sherwani, and more</li>\r\n 	<li>Perfect measurements for comfort and style</li>\r\n 	<li>Clean finishing using high-quality machines</li>\r\n 	<li>Modern designs, patterns, and cuts</li>\r\n 	<li>Wedding &amp; party wear stitching available</li>\r\n 	<li>Uniform stitching (school, office, factory)</li>\r\n 	<li>Quick delivery &amp; reliable service</li>\r\n 	<li>Alteration and repair services available</li>\r\n 	<li>High-quality threads, materials, and accessories used</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Best Tailoring and Stitching Services | Custom Fit, Premium Finish', 'Best Tailoring and Stitching Services offering professional perfect fitting, premium finishing, and custom designs. Specialists in shirts, pants, suits, kurta-pyjama, alterations, and more. Fast delivery and high-quality workmanship.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'best-tailoring-and-stitching', '', '', '2026-01-02 23:11:42', '2026-01-02 17:41:42', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8080/wordpress/?post_type=our_services&#038;p=684', 0, 'service', '', 0),
(687, 1, '2025-12-08 15:23:42', '2025-12-08 09:53:42', '<h2 class=\"h4 mb-3\">Where craftsmanship meets dependable service</h2>\nKing Tailors is a trusted and well-established tailoring and service shop in Ozar, Nashik, known for quality workmanship, honest pricing, and reliable customer service. What began as a men’s tailoring shop has grown into a one-stop destination for men’s tailoring, sewing machines, air coolers, spare parts, and repair services.\n\nWe proudly serve customers from Ozar and nearby areas of Nashik district, offering practical solutions for everyday needs under one roof.\n<h3 class=\"h4 mb-3\">Our Expertise</h3>\nAt King Tailors, we combine traditional tailoring skills with modern service solutions. Our experience allows us to understand customer requirements clearly and deliver results that last.\n<h3 class=\"h4 mb-3\">Men’s Tailoring Services</h3>\nWe specialize in custom stitching, alterations, and perfect fitting for daily wear, formal outfits, and special occasions. Every garment is crafted with attention to detail, comfort, and durability.\n<h3 class=\"h4 mb-3\">Sewing Machines – Sales &amp; Repair</h3>\nWe offer quality sewing machines, accessories, and spare parts for home users and professional tailors. Our repair services ensure machines perform smoothly and efficiently, saving you time and cost.\n<h3 class=\"h4 mb-3\">Air Coolers – Sales &amp; Service</h3>\nWe provide air coolers, spare parts, and servicing, designed to suit the local climate. Our focus is on performance, reliability, and long-term value for customers.\n<h3 class=\"h4 mb-3\">Why Choose King Tailors?</h3>\n<ul class=\"list-unstyled\">\n 	<li>✔ Experienced and skilled workmanship</li>\n 	<li>✔ Honest advice and affordable pricing</li>\n 	<li>✔ Reliable repair and maintenance services</li>\n 	<li>✔ Quality products and genuine spare parts</li>\n 	<li>✔ Trusted local shop in Ozar, Nashik</li>\n</ul>\nWe believe in building long-term relationships, not just completing transactions.\n<h4 class=\"h4\">Our Vision</h4>\nTo be recognized as a trusted local brand in Ozar and Nashik for tailoring, sewing machines, and cooling solutions — known for quality, reliability, and customer satisfaction.\n<h3 class=\"h4 mb-3\">Our Commitment</h4>\nAt King Tailors, customer satisfaction comes first. We are committed to:\n<ul>\n 	<li>Delivering consistent quality</li>\n 	<li>Offering dependable after-sales support</li>\n 	<li>Maintaining transparency and trust</li>\n 	<li>Continuously improving our services</li>\n</ul>\nWhether you need a perfectly stitched outfit, a new sewing machine, reliable repairs, or air cooler servicing, King Tailors is here to serve you with confidence and care.\n\n<strong>King Tailors — Quality, trust, and service under one roof.</strong>', 'Who we are?', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'who-we-are', '', '', '2026-02-12 20:08:38', '2026-02-12 14:38:38', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8080/wordpress/?page_id=687', 0, 'page', '', 0),
