(891, 1, '2025-12-14 00:29:54', '2025-12-13 18:59:54', 'Galaxy Tower Cooler with 30L water tank is a compact, energy-efficient, and portable cooling solution designed for homes, shops, offices, and personal spaces. With a powerful airflow system and 40–60 ft air throw coverage, this tower cooler delivers quick and uniform cooling even in hot and humid conditions. Its portable design with castor wheels, durable plastic body, and space-saving structure make it ideal for everyday use.\r\n\r\nWhether you need a table top cooler, a shop cooling unit, or a portable air cooler that can be moved easily from room to room, the Galaxy Tower Cooler offers reliable performance at an affordable cost.\r\n\r\n<strong>Key Features &amp; Specifications (Point-Wise)</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Cooler Type: </strong>Portable Tower Air Cooler / Mini Air Cooler</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Tank Capacity:</strong> 30 Litres (Mini variants available in 20–25 Litres)</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Air Throw Coverage:</strong> Strong airflow covering approximately 40 to 60 feet</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Blade Size:</strong> Equipped with a 12 Inch blade (9 Inch blade available in mini table top models)</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Material &amp; Build:</strong> Made from high-quality durable plastic, lightweight and rust-free</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Design:</strong> Slim tower design that saves space and blends with modern interiors</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Portability</strong>: Fitted with castor wheels for smooth and easy movement</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Usage Type</strong>: Suitable for home, office, shop, tailoring shop, clinic, showroom, and personal cooling</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Energy Efficiency</strong>: Low power consumption compared to traditional air conditioners</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Maintenance</strong>: Easy to clean and simple to maintain</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Availability</strong>: In Stock</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<strong>Why Choose Galaxy Tower Air Cooler?</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Compact size with powerful cooling performance</li>\r\n 	<li>Large water tank for longer cooling hours</li>\r\n 	<li>Easy to move and reposition as needed</li>\r\n 	<li>Ideal for both floor use and table top placement</li>\r\n 	<li>Cost-effective and eco-friendly cooling solution</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Galaxy Tower Air Cooler', 'Galaxy Tower Air Cooler with 30L water tank offers powerful cooling with 40–60 ft air throw. Portable design, castor wheels, durable plastic body & 12-inch blade. Ideal for home & shop use.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'galaxy-tower-air-cooler', '', '', '2026-02-26 23:52:17', '2026-02-26 18:22:17', '', 0, 'https://kingtailors.wuaze.com/?post_type=air_cooler&#038;p=891', 0, 'air_cooler', '', 0),
