i>\r\n 	<li>Easy mobility with smooth castor wheels</li>\r\n 	<li>Ideal for commercial and residential use</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Anand Grand-2 Heavy Duty Air Cooler', 'Anand Grand-2 Heavy Duty Air Cooler with powerful airflow for large rooms and commercial use. Durable desert cooler with energy-efficient performance', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'anand-grand-2-heavy-duty-air-cooler', '', '', '2026-02-26 22:43:08', '2026-02-26 17:13:08', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8080/wordpress/?post_type=air_cooler&#038;p=2633', 0, 'air_cooler', '', 0),
