(2635, 2, '2026-02-26 22:49:23', '2026-02-26 17:19:23', 'The Anand Java GlassTop Air Cooler combines powerful cooling performance with a modern and premium glass top design. Built for both residential and commercial use, this cooler delivers strong airflow to keep your space comfortable during hot summer days. Its durable construction, large water tank capacity, and energy-efficient operation make it ideal for homes, shops, tailoring stores, offices, and showrooms.\r\n\r\nThe elegant glass top finish enhances the cooler’s appearance, making it not just a cooling appliance but also a stylish addition to your space. With smooth mobility, efficient cooling, and reliable performance, the Anand Java GlassTop Air Cooler is a perfect choice for daily use.\r\n\r\n<strong>Key Features &amp; Specifications</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Cooler Type: </strong>Heavy Duty Desert Air Cooler with Glass Top</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Design: </strong>Premium Glass Top Design for modern and stylish look</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Cooling Performance: </strong>Powerful airflow for fast and effective cooling</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Body Material: </strong>Strong and durable heavy-duty construction for long life</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Water Tank Capacity: </strong>Large tank capacity for longer cooling duration</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Air Delivery: </strong>High-performance fan system ensures wide air coverage</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Mobility: </strong>Equipped with castor wheels for easy movement</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Usage: </strong>Suitable for home, shop, tailoring shop, office, showroom, and commercial spaces</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Energy Efficiency: </strong>Low power consumption for cost-effective cooling</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Maintenance: </strong>Easy to clean and simple to maintain</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Availability: </strong>In Stock</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2>Why Choose Anand Java GlassTop Air Cooler?</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Premium and modern glass top design</li>\r\n 	<li>Strong cooling performance for large areas</li>\r\n 	<li>Durable and long-lasting heavy-duty body</li>\r\n 	<li>Easy mobility with castor wheels</li>\r\n 	<li>Energy-efficient and economical cooling solution</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Anand Java GlassTop Air Cooler', 'Anand Java GlassTop Air Cooler with powerful cooling and premium glass top design. Heavy-duty desert cooler ideal for home, shop, and commercial use.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'anand-java-glasstop-air-cooler', '', '', '2026-02-26 22:55:39', '2026-02-26 17:25:39', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8080/wordpress/?post_type=air_cooler&#038;p=2635', 0, 'air_cooler', '', 0),
(2636, 2, '2026-02-26 22:55:33', '2026-02-26 17:25:33', '', 'anand-java-glass-top-air-cooler', '', 'inherit', 'open', 'closed', '', 'anand-java-glass-top-air-cooler', '', '', '2026-02-26 22:55:33', '2026-02-26 17:25:33', '', 2635, 'http://localhost:8080/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anand-java-glass-top-air-cooler.webp', 0, 'attachment', 'image/webp', 0),
(2637, 2, '2026-02-26 23:04:33', '2026-02-26 17:34:33', 'The Anand Geo Tower Glass Top Air Cooler is a stylish and high-performance cooling solution designed for modern homes, offices, shops, and showrooms. Featuring a sleek tower design with premium glass top finish, this cooler not only enhances your interior look but also delivers powerful and efficient cooling performance.\r\n\r\nBuilt with durable materials and a high-efficiency airflow system, the Anand Geo Tower Cooler ensures quick and uniform air circulation. Its compact vertical structure saves floor space, making it perfect for areas where traditional desert coolers may feel bulky. With energy-efficient operation and smooth mobility, it is an ideal choice for daily summer use.\r\n\r\n<strong>Key Features &amp; Specifications</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Cooler Type: </strong>Tower Air Cooler with Glass Top</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Design: </strong>Modern Geo Tower structure with premium glass top finish</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Cooling Performance: </strong>Powerful airflow for fast and uniform cooling</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Body Material: </strong>Durable heavy-duty construction for long-lasting use</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Water Tank Capacity: </strong>Large tank capacity for extended cooling hours</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Air Throw Coverage: </strong>Strong air delivery suitable for rooms, shops, and offices</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Mobility: </strong>Equipped with smooth castor wheels for easy movement</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Space Saving: </strong>Slim vertical tower design ideal for compact areas</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Energy Efficiency: </strong>Low electricity consumption compared to AC</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Maintenance: </strong>Easy to operate, clean, and maintain</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Availability: </strong>In Stock</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2>Why Choose Anand Geo Tower Glass Top Air Cooler?</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Elegant glass top with modern tower look</li>\r\n 	<li>Space-saving vertical design</li>\r\n 	<li>Powerful cooling for residential &amp; commercial use</li>\r\n 	<li>Durable and long-lasting build quality</li>\r\n 	<li>Energy-efficient and budget-friendly cooling solution</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Anand Geo Tower Glass Top Air Cooler', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'anand-geo-tower-glass-top-air-cooler', '', '', '2026-02-26 23:05:16', '2026-02-26 17:35:16', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8080/wordpress/?post_type=air_cooler&#038;p=2637', 0, 'air_cooler', '', 0),
(2638, 2, '2026-02-26 23:04:25', '2026-02-26 17:34:25', '', 'anand-geo-tower-glass-top-air-cooler', '', 'inherit', 'open', 'closed', '', 'anand-geo-tower-glass-top-air-cooler', '', '', '2026-02-26 23:04:25', '2026-02-26 17:34:25', '', 2637, 'http://localhost:8080/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anand-geo-tower-glass-top-air-cooler.webp', 0, 'attachment', 'image/webp', 0),
(2639, 2, '2026-02-26 23:52:06', '2026-02-26 18:22:06', '', '1 123', '', 'inherit', 'open', 'closed', '', '1-123', '', '', '2026-02-26 23:52:06', '2026-02-26 18:22:06', '', 891, 'http://localhost:8080/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/1-123.png', 0, 'attachment', 'image/png', 0),
